From b773f34392b78991480a750ac6169dc6a80f3fff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yinxin Sun <quic_yinxsun@quicinc.com>
Date: Fri, 29 Nov 2024 10:10:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] nftables: Add front-end for NATTYPE

Translate arguments from iptables to nftables.
Add the ability for nftables to deal with kernel NATTYPE module

Signed-off-by: Yinxin Sun <quic_yinxsun@quicinc.com>
